    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Burst Lightning was targeted at the opponent's face for 2 damage instead of killing Badgermole Cub, a 2/2 creature that also generates mana advantage (adds extra {G} when tapping creatures for mana) and has already created an earthbend land creature. The Cub is a value engine that will compound advantage over time, and 2 damage to face on turn 3 is largely irrelevant. Removing the Cub would slow down the opponent's ramp and board development significantly.",
